      "review_comments": [{"body":"[P0] Compilation error: wrong isConditionalPasskeysEnabled() overload\n\n`UsernameForm.authenticate()` calls `isConditionalPasskeysEnabled()` with no arguments, but `UsernamePasswordForm` defines `isConditionalPasskeysEnabled(UserModel user)` and requires a `UserModel` parameter. This will not compile; pass `context.getUser()` (or add a no-arg overload that delegates) so the call matches the available method signature.","created_at":"2026-01-29T21:52:37Z","html_url":"https://github.com/droid-code-review-evals/droid-keycloak/pull/1#discussion_r2743710726","id":2743710726,"line":47,"path":"services/src/main/java/org/keycloak/authentication/authenticators/browser/UsernameForm.java","side":"RIGHT"}],
